 config on startup for better traces and refactor npm install for improved error reporting\n\nConfig is now loaded eagerly during project bootstrap so users can see config loading in traces during startup. This helps diagnose configuration issues earlier in the initialization flow.\n\nNPM installation logic has been refactored with a unified reify function and improved InstallFailedError that includes both the packages being installed and the target directory. This provides users with complete context when package installations fail, making it easier to identify which dependency or project directory caused the issue."},{"Sha":"e0d71f124ef52f557387753ee19abe0f04f0faeb","Login":"kitlangton","IsBot":false,"AuthorName":"Kit Langton","AuthorEmail":"kit.langton@gmail.com","Date":"2026-04-16T20:12:46+00:00","Message":"tooling: add collapse-barrel.ts for single-namespace barrel migration (#22887)"},{"Sha":"1c33b866ba962ed7a4c147c316ad807886a0045e","Login":"kitlangton","IsBot":false,"AuthorName":"Kit Langton","AuthorEmail":"kit.langton@gmail.com","Date":"2026-04-16T20:11:05+00:00","Message":"fix: remove 10 more unnecessary \u0060as any\u0060 casts in opencode core (#22882)"},{"Sha":"5e650fd9e2c8ebaedb49af2ff771af9721782d98","Login":"kobicovaldev","IsBot":false,"AuthorName":"Kobi Hudson","AuthorEmail":"kobi@coval.dev","Date":"2026-04-16T20:01:21+00:00","Message":"fix(opencode): drop max_tokens for OpenAI reasoning models on Cloudflare AI Gateway (#22864)\n\nCo-authored-by: Aiden Cline \u003C63023139\u002Brekram1-node@users.noreply.github.com\u003E"},{"Sha":"76275fc3ab8f39cd02ae7eed87c47679e1f4c28e","Login":"kitlangton","IsBot":false,"AuthorName":"Kit Langton","AuthorEmail":"kit.langton@gmail.com","Date":"2026-04-16T19:49:21+00:00","Message":"refactor: move Pty into pty/index.ts with self-reexport (#22881)"},{"Sha":"6c3b28db64e47895553949880f296bae74691f4a","Login":"rekram1-node","IsBot":false,"AuthorName":"Aiden Cline","AuthorEmail":"63023139\u002Brekram1-node@users.noreply.g